WEBVTT

NOTE Paragraph timing uses generated clips; intra-paragraph timing is approximate.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.430
Let's look at dotfiles in Conficius, starting with the repository.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:08.882
This repo collects our tool configs in one place: Bash, Git,

00:00:08.882 --> 00:00:12.920
Neovim, Starship, and tmux. They're ordinary files, grouped by tool.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.173
Here's the actual Conficius config beside them. Each link

00:00:16.173 --> 00:00:19.427
names a source in the repo and the place

00:00:19.427 --> 00:00:22.680
it should appear under home or the config directory.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:27.615
Open Conficius and head into dotfiles. The overview shows which links need

00:00:27.615 --> 00:00:32.550
attention, which are blocked, and which already point to the right files.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.985
The links view brings those files together. Open a

00:00:35.985 --> 00:00:39.410
row to see the source, destination, and current state.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.080
Let's filter to actionable links and select one. This narrows the next

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:52.360
step to the file we want, rather than everything in the repo.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:56.393
Here's the preview before anything changes. It shows the link we'd

00:00:56.393 --> 00:01:00.060
create. We'll cancel and leave the files as they are.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:06.190
This Git config is blocked because there's already a file at

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:10.400
the destination. Conficius won't replace it through this link action.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:14.460
These links are healthy: they already point back

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:17.400
to the repo. There's nothing to fix here.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.993
Environment checks caught a config path that doesn't match

00:01:20.993 --> 00:01:24.586
the selected layout. Open the warning to see the

00:01:24.586 --> 00:01:27.380
current path and where Conficius expects it.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.670
Press the question mark whenever you need the keys.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.980
Then we're back at the overview. We've checked the

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.290
repo and reviewed a link plan without applying it.
